  "solution": {
    "text": "Here, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7.28</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.33</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math><br />The drop will evaporate if the water pressure is greater than the vapour pressure <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math><br />As <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac></math> where <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math> is the radius of drop<br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>7.28</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2.33</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6.25</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
